---
import LegacyLayout from '@/layouts/LegacyLayout.astro';
---

<LegacyLayout
  title="Honoring Our Guides"
  subPage="honoring-our-guides"
  eyebrow="Legacy"
  description="The institutions and mentors whose work made Developmental Theatre possible."
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-8">
    <section>
      <p class="text-lg">
        We are grateful perpetually for those who came before us as we evolve our training and
        decades of experience into an international Developmental Theatre: Fearless Creativity
        platform.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>The University of Colorado and the Colorado Caravan</h2>
      <p>
        We acknowledge with gratitude the University of Colorado&rsquo;s Colorado Caravan program,
        which in the 1970&rsquo;s fostered the opportunity to create a Developmental Theatre
        touring company and M.A. program.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Participants and Collaborators</h2>
      <p>
        Participants in the Colorado Caravan and the theatres which followed it are honored in the
        <a href="/legacy/timeline/" class="underline hover:text-clay-500">Timeline</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>The Teachers and Students</h2>
      {/* CLIENT REVIEW: students content pending */}
      <p>
        We thank the thousands of students who shaped Developmental Theatre through their
        participation, feedback, and creative contribution across fifty years.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</LegacyLayout>
